   Signals Reforged is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or implied, including warranties of
   merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose and non-infringement. Back up your worlds.

7. Limitation of liability
   To the extent permitted by applicable law, cptgummiball is not liable for any damages arising from the use of or
   inability to use Signals Reforged, including loss of data or of game worlds. Liability for intent and gross
   negligence, and any liability that cannot be excluded by law, remain unaffected.

8. Termination
   If you break this license, your rights under it end automatically.

9. Other
